  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nigeria Joint Analysis of Conflict and Stability - JACS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nationwide joint conflict analysis of Nigeria. The JACS Refresh will critically access the appropriateness of assumptions, policies, objectives, and plans by HMG in the context of Nigeria&#x2019;s evolving conflict and stability landscape, thereby strengthening our approach to conflict and stability in Nigeria and the region.</narrative>
  </description>
